---
// Flow of a dynamic style through the Style TOM plugin (build time) and the
// CSSTOM style runtime (in Gameface). Inline SVG so it follows the Starlight
// theme colors in light and dark mode.
---

<figure class="flow">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 262" role="img" aria-labelledby="tsf-title tsf-desc">
    <title id="tsf-title">How a dynamic style reaches Gameface</title>
    <desc id="tsf-desc">
      {"At build time the Style TOM plugin rewrites `${x()}px` into { value: x(), unit: 'px' }. On every change, the style runtime applies supported properties through CSSTOM and everything else through element.style."}
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker id="tsf-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="arrow-head" />
      </marker>
      <marker id="tsf-arrow-accent" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="arrow-head accent" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <rect x="220" y="1" width="200" height="40" rx="20" class="box" />
    <text x="320" y="26" class="code" text-anchor="middle">{'`${x()}px`'}</text>

    <line x1="320" y1="41" x2="320" y2="74" class="arrow" marker-end="url(#tsf-arrow)" />
    <text x="334" y="62" class="label">Style TOM plugin, at build time</text>

    <rect x="170" y="76" width="300" height="40" rx="20" class="box" />
    <text x="320" y="101" class="code" text-anchor="middle">{"{ value: x(), unit: 'px' }"}</text>

    <path d="M320,116 V142 M160,142 H480" class="arrow" />
    <text x="334" y="133" class="label">Style runtime, on every change</text>
    <line x1="160" y1="142" x2="160" y2="177" class="arrow accent" marker-end="url(#tsf-arrow-accent)" />
    <line x1="480" y1="142" x2="480" y2="177" class="arrow" marker-end="url(#tsf-arrow)" />

    <rect x="1" y="179" width="310" height="80" rx="8" class="box accent-box" />
    <text x="17" y="203" class="title accent-text">Supported property: CSSTOM</text>
    <text x="17" y="227" class="code">attributeStyleMap.set(…)</text>
    <text x="17" y="248" class="small">Only the number changes, no parsing</text>

    <rect x="329" y="179" width="310" height="80" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="345" y="203" class="title">Anything else: normal path</text>
    <text x="345" y="227" class="code">element.style.setProperty(…)</text>
    <text x="345" y="248" class="small">Gameface parses the string</text>
  </svg>
</figure>

<style>
  .flow {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  svg {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 40rem;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }
  .box {
    fill: var(--sl-color-bg-inline-code);
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .accent-box {
    fill: var(--sl-color-accent-low);
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent);
  }
  .arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .arrow.accent {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent);
  }
  .arrow-head {
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
  .arrow-head.accent {
    fill: var(--sl-color-accent);
  }
  text {
    fill: var(--sl-color-white);
    font-family: var(--sl-font, system-ui, sans-serif);
  }
  .title {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .accent-text {
    fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
  }
  .label {
    font-size: 13px;
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }
  .small {
    font-size: 13px;
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }
  .code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'Cascadia Code', Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-variant-ligatures: none;
    white-space: pre;
  }
</style>
